@@ -12,7 +12,15 @@ Usage:
     decode_ngap.py <pcap> [--procedure-code N] [--summary]
 
 Prints one line per NGAP PDU:
-    <src> -> <dst>  <kind>  procedureCode=<n>  [tmgi=<hex>]
